                        <a href="https://sportshandle.com/bet365-bonus-code-365-bonus-for-clemson-vs-lsu-cfb-week-1-games/">bet365 Bonus Code: $365 Bonus for Clemson vs. LSU, CFB Week 1 Games</a>
                    </h3>
                    <div class="jeg_post_meta"><div class="jeg_meta_author coauthor"><span class="meta_text by">by</span><a href="https://sportshandle.com/author/ltran/">Lee Tran</a></div><div class="jeg_meta_date"><a href="https://sportshandle.com/bet365-bonus-code-365-bonus-for-clemson-vs-lsu-cfb-week-1-games/"><i class="fa fa-clock-o"></i> September 5, 2026</a></div></div>
                    <div class="jeg_post_excerpt">
                        <p>The bet365 bonus code offer gives eligible new users $365 in bonus bets after a qualifying $10 wager, regardless of whether that first bet wins or loses. No actual promo code needs to be entered, and the offer is available in Louisiana ahead of one of Saturday's biggest college football games. Clemson vs. LSU kicks off Saturday, Sept. 5 at 7:30 p.m. ET on ABC from Tiger Stadium. LSU enters as a double-digit favorite in Lane Kiffin's first game as</p>
