</div></div></div></div><div class="row vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid mpc-row"><div class="jeg-vc-wrapper"><div class="wpb_column jeg_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12 jeg_main_content mpc-column" data-column-id="mpc_column-496aa07777280e9"><div class="jeg_wrapper wpb_wrapper"><div class="vc_separator wpb_content_element vc_separator_align_center vc_sep_width_100 vc_sep_pos_align_center vc_separator_no_text vc_sep_color_grey wpb_content_element  wpb_content_element"><span class="vc_sep_holder vc_sep_holder_l"><span class="vc_sep_line"></span></span><span class="vc_sep_holder vc_sep_holder_r"><span class="vc_sep_line"></span></span>
</div>
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element">
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p>SportsHandle, launched in 2017, is home for information on the legal U.S. sports wagering industry &mdash; legislation, business, and policy. The team is comprised of veteran journalists who deliver original and investigative reporting, opinion, and analysis of <a href="https://sportshandle.com/sports-betting/">sports betting legislation</a> and regulation at the state and federal levels, plus coverage of the sports betting business landscape.</p>
<p>Our iGaming experience also allows us to publish expert reviews of <a href="https://sportshandle.com/mobile-sportsbooks/">U.S. sports betting apps</a>, the <a href="https://sportshandle.com/best-sports-betting-sites/">best sports betting sites</a>, <a href="https://sportshandle.com/best-dfs-sites/">daily fantasy sports (DFS) platforms</a>, the <a href="https://sportshandle.com/best-prediction-market-apps/">best prediction market apps</a>, and the <a href="https://sportshandle.com/online-casinos/">best online casinos</a>, helping you compare operators to find the best options. SportsHandle&rsquo;s extensive testing means you can trust our recommendations and get started with preferred iGaming providers. And whether you&rsquo;re new to wagering or looking to refine your strategy, our <a href="https://sportshandle.com/betting-guides/">betting guides explore everything</a> from understanding odds to managing your bankroll.</p>
<p>For more on who we are, <a href="https://sportshandle.com/contact/">click here</a>.</p>
